event: response.output_text.done
data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","sequence_number":64,"item_id":"msg_01c39f2f2ec6372e016adf7122a08c8194b642f40f309be12b","output_index":1,"content_index":0,"text":"The search couples each yaw change with a random position move, so a worse preferred distance can cause a useful rotation to be rejected. I’ll add a bounded distance correction to floor-object proposals, preserving their tangential movement and yaw variation. The query budget and final selection rule will stay unchanged.","logprobs":[]}

